    "text": "Kenya Meteorological Department (KMD) — forecast for Kisumu\nValid for 2026-09-27.\nMax 32.0C / Min 20.0C.\nTonight: Partly cloudy with a chance of Light showers and thunderstorms likely over few places\nMorning: Sunny intervals\nAfternoon: Sunny intervals\nNational outlook mentions this area:\n  - Light to moderate rains expected over few places across Kakamega, Kisumu, Siaya, Busia, Trans",
